<section><div class="wrap narrow">
<p class="eyebrow">Before you ask</p>
<h2 style="font-size:32px;margin-bottom:14px">Every question, answered.</h2>
<p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--burgundy);margin:28px 0 12px">About the Product</p>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What is Vallore SuperBalance and what does it do? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Vallore SuperBalance is a daily drink-mix supplement designed to support three interconnected hormonal systems — ovarian (estrogen rhythm), adrenal (cortisol and stress), and metabolic (insulin and energy). It combines six studied ingredients at clinically-informed doses in a strawberry lemonade you mix with water. It's not a medication; it supports general wellness and hormone function as defined by structure/function claims.*</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How is Vallore different from other hormone supplements? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Most options address one hormone at a time — magnesium here, ashwagandha there — and bury their doses in "proprietary blends." Vallore prints every dose, targets all three systems in one serving, and comes in a form (a drink) most women actually maintain long-term. No blend math, no mystery milligrams.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is this a pill or a powder? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">It's a water-soluble stick pack — tear, stir into 8–12 oz of water, drink. No pills, no capsule gag reflex. Strawberry lemonade flavor. Most women add it to their morning water routine or pair it with breakfast.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Does it have caffeine? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">No. We deliberately left caffeine out. The gentle energy you feel from Vallore comes from 25 mg of theobromine — the feel-good compound naturally found in cacao — which gives a calm, clean lift without the spike or the crash. You can take Vallore alongside your morning coffee with no problem.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What does it taste like? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Strawberry lemonade. Genuinely. It was designed to be something you look forward to, not something you get down because you have to. It mixes clean — no chalkiness, no aftertaste, no protein-powder thickness.</div></div>
<p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--burgundy);margin:28px 0 12px">Safety &amp; Who It's For</p>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is it safe to take with birth control? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">The ingredients in Vallore — Shatavari, Myo-Inositol, Rhodiola, Magnesium, Theobromine, Vitamins C and B6 — are commonly used daily supplements. They are not known to interact with most oral contraceptives at these doses. That said, we always recommend checking with your doctor or pharmacist if you're on any medication, including hormonal birth control, before adding any supplement.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Can I take Vallore if I'm pregnant or nursing? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">We recommend you do not take Vallore while pregnant or nursing without your doctor's approval. Some adaptogens, including Shatavari and Rhodiola, have not been studied sufficiently in pregnant populations to give a blanket clearance. Your safety always comes first — consult your OB or midwife before use.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is this for all ages? What's the minimum age? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Vallore is formulated for adult women 18 and over. It is not designed or tested for use in adolescents or children. If you have questions about whether it's appropriate for a young adult, speak with their healthcare provider.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">I have PCOS / endometriosis / thyroid issues — is Vallore safe? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Many women with these conditions take Myo-Inositol and adaptogens as part of their wellness routine — Myo-Inositol in particular is heavily researched in PCOS populations. However, Vallore is not a medical treatment and we can't make condition-specific recommendations. Please check with your endocrinologist or gynecologist before adding it to your regimen.</div></div>
<p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--burgundy);margin:28px 0 12px">Results &amp; Timing</p>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">When will I feel a difference? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Theobromine (energy) and Magnesium (relaxation) can be felt within the first few days. Adaptogens like Shatavari and Rhodiola are cumulative — most women notice mood and cycle improvements in weeks 2–4. The full effect of a true hormonal reset typically takes 6–8 weeks of consistent daily use. That's why we recommend giving it at least 40-day supply before judging the results.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What if I miss a day? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Don't stress about it. Missing a day won't undo your progress — the adaptogens build over time, not in a single dose. Just pick up where you left off the next morning. The one thing we'd suggest avoiding is stopping and restarting repeatedly, which delays the compounding effect.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Will it work if I'm in perimenopause or post-menopause? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Several of Vallore's ingredients — especially Shatavari, Rhodiola, and Magnesium Malate — are widely used by women across all hormonal stages. While the formula was designed with cyclical hormone support in mind, many of the benefits (cortisol balance, energy, mood, sleep quality) are relevant at any stage. As always, speak with your doctor about your specific situation.</div></div>
<p style="font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--burgundy);margin:28px 0 12px">Ordering &amp; Subscription</p>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is the subscription a trap? Can I cancel? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">No. Subscribe to save 20%, and cancel, skip, or pause anytime — before your next renewal, without a phone call, and without a fee. If you'd rather not commit, choose a one-time purchase. We'll never auto-charge you without a subscription, and if something goes wrong on our end, email us and we'll make it right.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How does the "3+1 free" work? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Buy three pouches at once and we include a fourth one free — effectively $17.50 per pouch versus $29.99 for a single. It's the most cost-effective way to do a proper 80-day reset, which is the timeline where the adaptogens in the formula really compound. You pay $69.99 and receive four pouches (80 servings total).</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">How fast is shipping? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Orders typically ship within 1–2 business days. Standard delivery is 3–5 business days across the contiguous US. Orders over $50 ship free. Expedited options are available at checkout. We don't currently ship internationally, but we're working on it.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">What's the 60-day guarantee, exactly? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Give Vallore 60 full days. If you don't feel steadier, more energized, or more like yourself — for any reason — email us at hello@vallore.com and we'll refund your most recent order in full. Even if the pouch is empty. No restocking fee, no "you have to try it for X more days," no guilt. The only catch: first-time orders only, and one refund per household. We do this because we believe in the product and we'd rather earn your trust than keep your money.</div></div>
<div class="faq-item"><div class="faq-q">Is Vallore 3rd-party tested? <span class="msym faqicon"><svg aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.7" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"></path></svg></span></div><div class="faq-a">Yes. Every batch of Vallore is tested by an independent third-party lab for purity, label accuracy, heavy metals, and contaminants. <span class="phr">[Link to COA / lab panel here before launch.]</span> You're getting exactly what the label says — nothing more, nothing less.</div></div>
